/T (In conclusion, this report presents a breakthrough in regenerative dermatology, showcasing the therapeutic potential of ExoGenesis huC-MSC-derived exosomes in treating follicular degeneration. The advanced delivery system, high-purity composition, and molecular efficacy position ExoGenesis as a promising intervention for reversing alopecia and rejuvenating scalp tissue through non-surgical, exosome-based therapy.)
