/Title (Hair regrowth and scalp tissue response were evaluated using a semi-quantitative follicular density scoring system adapted from prior models. Two blinded dermatological researchers independently assessed regrowth by scoring follicular reactivation within the treated area, with scores ranging from 0 \(no visible regrowth\) to 9 \(full follicle density and shaft emergence\). For scalp sensitivity, von Frey filaments were applied to the dorsal surface to measure mechanosensory response. The withdrawal threshold, indicating functional nerve sensitivity within the regenerative tissue, was recorded as the time to response. Each test was repeated three times at 10-minute intervals, and the mean value was used for analysis. Assessments were conducted on days 1, 3, 7, 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, and 56 following exosome application.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1299 0 R
>>
endobj
